**`selfflow.v` (compiles, no assumptions):**
- `self_remove_flow`: a precise flow in the view `G & x ~ open_typ_p (pvar x) Vc` becomes a precise flow in the heap context `G` (the self binding is simulated by `pf_bind x : μVc` + `pf_open`);
- `self_remove_precise2` and `self_remove_precise3`: the same transformation for precise2/precise3.

This lets field-resolution results obtained in the view context feed `precise2_lookup` under `HInv γ G`.

